    "text": "<p>In this section, we covered the following:</p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li>\n\t<p>We saw another example of a <code>class</code> with <code>Book</code>, and some more methods.</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>\n\t<p>We learned that <code>String</code> is a <code>class</code>, and that it has many useful methods defined for it (e.g. <code>equals()</code>, which is used to compare <code>String</code>s for equality).</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>\n\t<p>We saw how we can turn our examples into <strong>tests</strong>, which have some nice features for summarizing our examples and reporting mistakes.</p>\n\t</li>\n</ul>",
